  "question": {
    "text": "A line makes angles of $45^{\\circ}$ and $60^{\\circ}$ with the positive axes of $X$ and $Y$ respectively. The angle made by the same line with the positive axis of $Z$, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
